这是基于基础版任务而设计的额外版本，包含以下新功能：
1、获取实时时间；
2、随机彩色打印和随机睡眠；
3、更严格的逻辑验证；
4、新增了 Laptop 部分；
5、重构代码形式（因为项目较小，不存在后期维护一说，所以我将部分方法合并，调整了方法之间的关系）；
6、高度模仿 Spring 框架，实现代码块分离，更易理解；
7、取消了测试类代码（原代码逻辑严谨，不通过 get, set 方法测试）；
8、取消了不必要的接口；
9、使用了转换器，使得序列化等操作支持 final, static 等关键字；
10、重构目录布局，更易理解。

可能还有额外功能，如果老师们愿意，可以尝试运行我的代码，希望给你们带来不一样的体验。
感谢老师们能抽出时间来检查额外版本的任务，祝老师们工作顺利、生活愉快！

This is an additional version designed based on the basic version of the assignment, including the following new features:
1. Obtain real - time;
2. Random color printing and random sleep;
3. More stringent logical verification;
4. Added the Laptop section;
5. Refactored the code form (since the project is small and there is no need for later maintenance, I merged some methods and adjusted the relationships between methods);
6. Highly imitated the Spring framework to achieve code block separation, making it easier to understand;
7. Removed the test class code (the original code has a rigorous logic and is not tested through get and set methods);
8. Removed unnecessary interfaces;
9. Used a converter to enable operations such as serialization to support keywords like final and static;
10. Refactored the directory layout to make it easier to understand.

There may be additional features. If teachers are willing, they can try to run my code, hoping to bring you a different experience.
Thank you teachers for taking the time to check the tasks of the additional version. Wish you all a smooth work and a happy life!